<title>LATVIA: OLAINE PEAT SHARE ISSUE REGISTERED.</title>
<headline>OLAINE PEAT SHARE ISSUE REGISTERED.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities commission on Tuesday said that it had registered a share issue of 1.19 million shares with a nominal value of one lat for the Olaine Peat factory.</p>
<p>Some 20 percent of Olaine's shares were available in a public offer for vouchers until May 9 and the controlling stake was earlier bought by Latvia's Mono company.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
